msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.DemoWorld.L06
msgid "States that the equality relation `=` in the naturals `Nat` is decidable, that is, that for any naturals `m n : Nat`, we either have `m = n` or `¬(m = n)`<=>`m ≠ n`, that is, `(m = n) ∨ (m ≠ n)`."
msgstr ""

